<title>UK: NSW Treasury Corp sets 15 bln yen three-year bond.</title>
<headline>NSW Treasury Corp sets 15 bln yen three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual currency bond was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW SOUTH WALES TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE CROWN IN RIGHT OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.8	 MATURITY    13.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	DUAL CURRENCY, REDEMPTION IS IN U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2	 DENOMS (K) 500	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
